### Variants
`plain` drops the border and the hover feedback.
:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="CardVariantsDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <template>
    <TxCard variant="solid">solid</TxCard>
    <TxCard variant="dashed">dashed</TxCard>
