### Overlay Panels
Popover, SearchSelect, and other overlays render their panel with TxCard, configured through `panel-*` props.
:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="CardCardCompositionsDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <template>
    <TxPopover
      panel-variant="solid"
      panel-shadow="soft"
      :panel-radius="18"
      :panel-padding="10"
    >
      <template #reference>
        <TxButton variant="primary">Popover panel</TxButton>
      </template>
      Popover panel uses TxCard
    </TxPopover>
    <TxSearchSelect
      v-model="value"
      :options="options"
      panel-shadow="soft"
      :panel-radius="18"
      :panel-padding="6"
    />
  </template>
---
:::

